  "solution": "Logic : [1st number × (1st number + 4)] = 2nd number\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 5:45\n\n5 × (5 + 4)__ = 45\n\n__**5 × 9**__ = 45\n\n45 = 45 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 2:10\n\n2 × (2 + 4)__ = 10\n\n__**2 × 6**__ = 10\n\n**12 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 3:21\n\n3 × (3 + 4)__ = 21\n\n__**3 × 7**__ = 21\n\n21 = 21 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 4:32\n\n4 × (4 + 4)__ = 32\n\n__**4 × 8**__ = 32\n\n32 = 32 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
